  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diagnosis Mining activities Guatemala</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diagnosis Mining activities Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att genomf&#xf6;ra en helt&#xe4;ckande bed&#xf6;mning av den metalliska gruvverksamheten i Guatemala, med h&#xe4;nsyn till dess p&#xe5;verkan, risker, m&#xf6;jligheter och styrningskontext, i syfte att ta fram rekommendationer f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra f&#xf6;rvaltningen, st&#xe4;rka institutionerna och utg&#xf6;ra en grund f&#xf6;r Sidas samarbetsinriktning gentemot de mest relevanta akt&#xf6;rerna inom de omr&#xe5;den som identifierats som m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r kapacitetsst&#xe4;rkande insatser</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To conduct a comprehensive assessment of metallic mining activity in Guatemala, considering
its impacts, risks, opportunities and governance context, in order to generate recommendations
for improving management, strengthening institutions, and serving as a basis
for Sida&apos;s cooperation approach towards the most relevant actors in the areas identified with
opportunities for strengthening</narrative>
  </description>
